::kind(api)

::meta{crate: tomet-shelf-incremental, dependencies: list(tomet-shelf-document), dependents: list(tomet-shelf-headless)}

=[tomet-shelf-incremental]

==[tomet-shelf-incremental]

Incremental state, cache, and change detection for `tomet-shelf`.

Orchestrates on-disk cache persistence, mtime/size comparison for zero-I/O
unchanged skips, and integration with `tomet::deps` for invalidation impact analysis.

==[Module cache]

Persistent vault cache file management and serialization.

===[Structs]

====[struct VaultCache]

In-memory and persistent container for cached document entries across a vault.

===[Constants]

====[const CACHE_FILE_NAME]

Filename of the on-disk incremental cache.

====[const CURRENT_SCHEMA_VERSION]

Current schema version of the cache.
Incrementing this invalidates older cache files safely.

==[Module diff]

Change detection between filesystem state and the incremental cache.

===[Structs]

====[struct ScannedDoc]

Descriptor of a scanned document file on disk.

====[struct ChangedDoc]

A document that changed on disk and requires re-reading and parsing.

====[struct ChangeDetectionResult]

Partition of scanned files compared against the previous cache.

===[Functions]

====[fn detect_changes]

Detects changes by comparing current scanned vault files against the previous cache.

====[fn reconcile_vault_state]

Helper to reconcile unchanged entries with newly parsed updates into updated cache and change list.

==[Module entry]

Cache entry and filesystem signature data models.

===[Structs]

====[struct FileSignature]

Filesystem fingerprint of a source document.

====[struct CacheEntry]

A cached record for a single document.
